OL,3,GNEWSATram strikes set to continue until
OL,4,ANew Year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA further 25 days of strike action on
OL,7,FNottingham's tram network have been
OL,8,Fannounced as part of an ongoing pay
OL,9,Fdispute.
OL,11,FIndustrial action is due to take place
OL,12,Fevery week, beginning on 22 October up
OL,13,Funtil 31 December, including every
OL,14,Fweekend in the lead-up to Christmas.
OL,16,FThe GMB Union said its members had been
OL,17,Fin talks with Nottingham Express
OL,18,FTransit (NET) for almost a year and
OL,19,Fwalk-outs during the busiest festive
OL,20,Fweeks was "the last thing they want".
OL,22,FNET has been approached for comment.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
